Subject: [PATCH] ath11k: match the pinned NSS driver's statistics wire layout

The firmware recipe compiles qca-nss-drv with NSS_FIRMWARE_VERSION_12_5.
ath11k consumes the same exported nss_wifili_if.h but lacks that define:
peer records are shorter, and batched peer/retry statistics are misread.
Match the provider's flag when ath11k NSS support is selected. This patch
targets the pinned 90448ee recipe, not arbitrary firmware versions.

--- a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath11k/Makefile
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath11k/Makefile
@@ -1,3 +1,4 @@
 # SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause-Clear
+ccflags-$(CPTCFG_ATH11K_NSS_SUPPORT) += -DNSS_FIRMWARE_VERSION_12_5
 obj-$(CPTCFG_ATH11K) += ath11k.o
 ath11k-y += core.o \
